    "body": "Per the linked comment, HTMLOrSVGImageElement, as it's a subset of those two.\r\n\r\nI agree the two are reasonably located according to who uses them, but having the three spread out throughout the spec is confusing, and I'd suggest consolidating all into a single section, perhaps very early in the terminology section or something. Plus advice on other specs on how to use them.",
