    "updated_at": "2018-01-17T17:46:02Z",
    "body": "If other specifications want to reuse these they should probably figure out how to abstract the algorithms we define on top of them.\r\n\r\nI was think they might be different due to async/sync, but that does not explain `ImageBitmapSource` having `ImageData` and `CanvasImageSource` not having it.",
