    "created_at": "2021-04-05T21:55:22Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-04-05T21:55:22Z",
    "body": "FYI, I'm currently aware of:\r\n* [`CanvasImageSource`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/#canvasimagesource) (HTML, currently `HTMLImageElement`, `SVGImageElement`, `HTMLVideoElement`, `HTMLCanvasElement`, `ImageBitmap` or `OffscreenCanvas`)\r\n* [`TexImageSource`](https://www.khronos.org/registry/webgl/specs/latest/1.0/#5.14) (WebGL) (`CanvasImageSource` minus `SVGImageElement` and plus `ImageData`), and\r\n*  [`ImageBitmapSource`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/#imagebitmapsource) (HTML, `CanvasImageSource` plus `Blob` and `ImageData`)\r\n\r\nthough I have vague memories of seeing a fourth somewhere (but it might have been `ImageBitmapSource`).",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
