    "updated_at": "2021-04-05T21:55:51Z",
    "body": "Note WebCodecs would probably expect to add `VideoFrame` to some unions.\r\n\r\nWebGPU is working on adding similar but more restricted enums in two places, tentatively:\r\n\r\n- [GPUImageCopyExternalImage](https://github.com/gpuweb/gpuweb/pull/1581) to copy from \"image sources\" into WebGPU GPUTextures\r\n- [GPUExternalTextureDescriptor](https://github.com/gpuweb/gpuweb/issues/1415#issuecomment-796880809) to import of certain \"image sources\" for zero-copy reads from WebGPU",
